					<div id="dsq-comment-body-24" class="dsq-comment-body">
						<div id="dsq-comment-message-24" class="dsq-comment-message"><p>I haven&#8217;t tried the Query Generator with 2.0, but just the fact that it&#8217;s creating the hbm.cs file is telling us the generator is at least trying.  What version of the Generator are you using?  Did you build from trunk or download a release?</p>
<p>If I remember correctly (not always a good bet), if your mapping file is invalid, it will leave a blank .cs file, but hopefully you&#8217;ve confirmed that.</p>
</div>
