<p>It also doesn&#8217;t work when I overwrite the executable file (from the installer) with my own built version.</p>
<p>Mapping files are valid, since they work fine when I used the latest built of the generator from the trunk. <img src='http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_sad.gif' alt=':(' class='wp-smiley' /> </p>
